{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20017746,"chapterID":15000303,"chapterNumber":"III-3","sectionNumber":"33-291","title":"Required yards along district boundary coincident with side lot line of zoning lot in an R1, R2, R3, R4 or R5 District","officialText":"","previewText":"C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8\n\nIn all districts, as indicated, along such portion of the boundary of a Commercial District that coincides with a side lot line of a zoning lot in an R1, R2, R3, R4 or R5 District an open area not higher than curb level shall be provided within the Commercial District with at least the width or depth set forth in the following table. Such an open area shall not be used for accessory off-stree","blocks":[{"id":"zr-17746-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8</span></p>","plainText":"C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8"},{"id":"zr-17746-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In all districts, as indicated, along such portion of the boundary of a <strong><em>Commercial District</em></strong> that coincides with a <strong><em>side lot line</em></strong> of a <strong><em>zoning lot</em></strong> in an R1, R2, R3, R4 or R5 District an open area not higher than <strong><em>curb level</em></strong> shall be provided within the <strong><em>Commercial District</em></strong> with at least the width or depth set forth in the following table. Such an open area shall not be used for <strong><em>accessory</em></strong> off-street loading, or for storage or processing of any kind.</span></p>","plainText":"In all districts, as indicated, along such portion of the boundary of a Commercial District that coincides with a side lot line of a zoning lot in an R1, R2, R3, R4 or R5 District an open area not higher than curb level shall be provided within the Commercial District with at least the width or depth set forth in the following table. Such an open area shall not be used for accessory off-street loading, or for storage or processing of any kind."},{"id":"zr-17746-block-00